OL,3,GNEWSAHSE 'working urgently' on building
OL,4,Acollapse clean-up                      
OL,6,FThe Health and Safety Executive (HSE)  
OL,7,Fhas said it is "working urgently" to   
OL,8,Fhelp make the site of a partial        
OL,9,Fbuilding collapse safe.                
OL,11,FAn apartment block under construction  
OL,12,Fon the A4260 Cherwell Street in Banbury
OL,13,Fpartly collapsed alongside scaffolding 
OL,14,Fon 21 October, closing the road for    
OL,15,Fnine days.                             
OL,17,FThe road has since been partially      
OL,18,Freopened, but local councillor Paul    
OL,19,FAustin Sargent accused the HSE of      
OL,20,F"holding the town to ransom" over      
OL,21,Fdelays related to the clear-up of the  
OL,22,Fsite.                                  
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
