OL,3,GNEWSAHSE 'working urgently' on building
OL,4,Acollapse clean-up                      
OL,6,FResponding, a HSE spokesperson said it 
OL,7,Fwas "working urgently with the         
OL,8,Fcontractors on site as they seek to    
OL,9,Fmake it safe".                         
